{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/836e30936a55ca33c1fcfd4e3a474acf.avif?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=210 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/6d0af4b18e6b95afb6830b6d71178935.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is an unfulfilled chef who can cook anything. One day, his life turns upside down when his food begins to turn into different girls, evening after evening.<br><br>A cute and cozy game about cooking and dating.\u00a0Cook different food in interesting games, and then spend unforgettable evenings with different consequences with cute girls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/f87e28af8025e6d54a69e8a3b087313c.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cozy and beautiful game. We tried very hard to create a comfortable and relaxing atmosphere through a unique visual style, pleasant music and moderate difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/e34657968d8a113905584889453d255d.avif?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/da046dfecc985077e35ab2f3ec0b3c32.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters for all tastes. All the girls have their own unique personalities that match the food they embody. Each has her own backstory, thoughts and concerns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/bb5a0b59b331442325fdbb69a968675d.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young worker in her family's store. Maybe this is not an ordinary store, and maybe she is not an ordinary girl. Get to know her better in a big romance story. Perhaps she will be the one who can give you happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/984647f4725663ff9043bf63240b2c62.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and caring in the daytime, hot at night. Saves her delicious juiciness for &quot;that one&quot;. She does not tolerate careless treatment, but is ready to give herself completely to someone who has put his soul into her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/b35d0b5c8178f5c6e45ca923fb2595a3.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A headstrong and proud girl. It won't be easy to reach her feminine nature, but it's worth it. Cold but elegant, just as sushi should be. Familiar with a bright life, but maybe she wants something else?\u200b\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/a2d4d4da2be6be1b23c86a57ba5dc548.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A really hot girl. Maybe that's the hotness you need in your life right now?\u00a0The main question is: will you be able to handle her or will she have to play with you? With such dishes you need to warn. We are not afraid for her, but for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/225d522c03397a78bb06e91236c79a2b.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stately and strong woman who can endure two hours in the kitchen and in the oven. Large volumes and a lot of layers can satisfy any hungry mouth. She is just waiting for a real man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/7f8eb04a8ff19fd5adac65e356b4be00.avif?t=1757514244\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real cutie. A bit shy though. Prefers to remain cool and keep herself in check so as not to accidentally melt from strong emotions. Try to be gentle and careful with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/fa81e508a10330805073f71b815f98f1.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interesting and unique characters are coming. We can't wait to get them into the game and show it to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/b2587843767d532475dce19f29244cdc.avif?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/7c35f13a7c1634850d9495dd211fab2e.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls are voiced on all dates.\u00a0Authentic voice acting with russian girls. Spend a good time with their gentle voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/83a8d90847ab5ef20dfa3ccc43b9fefa.webp?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings and\u00a0unique scenes for\u00a0each character.\u00a0Open all endings to unlock the secret one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/3962d95bac45e18d0940335349c96459.poster.avif?t=1757514244\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/3962d95bac45e18d0940335349c96459.webm?t=1757514244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/3962d95bac45e18d0940335349c96459.mp4?t=1757514244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/861909f7fc9190accb7723e9fcac6d19.poster.avif?t=1757514244\" width=630 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/861909f7fc9190accb7723e9fcac6d19.webm?t=1757514244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/861909f7fc9190accb7723e9fcac6d19.mp4?t=1757514244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></